{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_03_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_03","title":"競走賽","storyCode":"OF-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"405bd97c93732cd8d2a7708c18bec6695ea890ceb34b2da8306f1c2be0f84a87","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"危機解除後，博士與錫蘭回到旅館與名為赫拉格的老年劍士會合。\n而赫拉格似乎有話要說。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保鏢A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燙燙燙！焦了焦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保鏢B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫！我的頭髮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保鏢A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，撤退，撤退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，果然還是打架有意思啊，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，博士，我這是為了救你，而且也聽你的話沒有下重手了，你可不許告訴赫默我打架的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被她知道了我的作業肯定又要變多了！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒問題。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我就知道博士是個好人！"}]},{"label":"作業你要自己努力。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那我可不管！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"源石驅動的火焰噴射器......而且這個功率，好厲害的術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"大姐，你的眼光不錯欸，我超厲害的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫錫蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你救了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦......沒關係。這，這是我該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，這個姐姐好懂禮貌啊，這種時候我該怎麼做來著？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"微笑。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"鞠躬。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"跳舞。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，好吧，那我試......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我忘記我的烤肉還在架子上了！我不跟你們多說了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，錫蘭，你們之後要是想吃燒烤記得來找我啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"竟然直接就跑開了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們也趕緊回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你們平安無事，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"十分感謝您的相助，請問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我赫拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"和博士一樣，我也來自羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你現在有時間嗎，有些話我要單獨告訴你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","aliases":["伊芙利特"]},{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["？？？","赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
